title: ONGOING grains
pid: 2762150a-91c7-4781-ac26-7021bfc7e81c
body: |2-
  1 "cup" = the nice square glass kind, with 1/2" slack at top
  grains : 3 cups, barley + amaranth, about 50/50
  water : 9 cups water

  Boiled at high heat in exactly 10 minutes.
  Spent 1 hr at 1.4 heat. Was still underwater.
  Spent 1 hr at 4 heat. Smoke happened.
  Spent 60 min at 2 heat.
  Still underwater; set 20 min alarm.
